**Key Insight:**  
LGBT criminalisation in Africa correlates far more strongly with **retained colonial penal codes** than with latitude, ethnicity, or climate. Where Roman-Dutch or reformed civil codes dominate, legality tends to follow—even in culturally conservative societies.